t failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  15 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 11 49 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast   are 5 fragments of soft  tan tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  which are submitted in toto as A  Gross Description by  Jason Corbin Resident  HENRY DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  David Bent Smith  M D  Colleen M Collins MD Robin Schoenthaler  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   CORE BIOPSIES   report_end  , Unchecked.
