 pink to white lobulated blue stained fibrous tissue  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma consists of tan yellow to white lobulated unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  Along the periphery  no lymph nodes are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  Posterior margin taken adjacent to overlying superior cystic fibrotic area  B  Anterior soft tissue margin taken adjacent to overlying superior cystic fibrotic area  C F  Entire superior  upper outer quadrant  cystic ill defined fibrotic area  G  Parenchyma in between two suspicious areas  H  Posterior margin taken adjacent to inferior lobulated fibrotic area  I  Inferior anterior soft tissue taken adjacent to the inferior lobulated fibrotic area  J L  Ill defined lobulated inferior fibrotic area entirely submitted  M N  Uninvolved parenchyma  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  sentinel node hot and blue  REMOVED_CASE_ID  left axilla   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan yellow portion of fibrofatty tissue containing two tan pink rubbery lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm which are entirely submitted for frozen section as FX  1  now as O  The remaining fibrofatty tissue is entirely submitted in cassette P  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  second left axillary sentinel node 12 480   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregular portion of tan yellow lobulated fibrofatty tissue containing two tan pink rubbery lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm which are entirely submitted for frozen section as FX  2  now as Q  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  additional left axillary tissue   are REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 2cm of irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated portio