ted as G J  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin lateral  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of unremarkable tan yellow fibrofatty breast tissue  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as K M  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right sentinel node  are several tan pink lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  There is a small amount of attached adipose tissue  The lymph nodes are entirely submitted as follows  N  2 possible whole lymph nodes  O  1 lymph node bisected  Gross Description by  SHANNON SCHUTZ Resident  ELENA BRACHTEL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODE RIGHT SENTINEL  EXCISION PART C  BREAST RIGHT FINAL SHAVED MARGIN MEDIAL CAVITY  EX PART D  BREAST RIGHT FINAL SHAVED MARGIN LATERAL CAVITY  E , Unchecked.
